✅ Streaming Best Practices
✅ Use streaming for large files or DB results
✅ Avoid converting stream to string — it loads full data
✅ Use pagination + streaming for huge database tables
✅ Prefer repeatable streams when using multiple components
✅ Avoid logging entire payload (will consume stream)

✅ Common Problems & Fixes
❌ Error: "Stream is closed"
Cause:

Payload read once already
✅ Solution:

Enable repeatable streaming
Set streaming="AUTO" or ALWAYS in HTTP request
❌ Out Of Memory Errors
Cause:

Loading large payload in RAM
✅ Fix:

Use File Store repeatable stream
